        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sonic Chronicles: The Dark Brotherhood, Sonic the Hedgehog series\n- People: Knuckles, Doctor Eggman, Shade the Echidna, Ix\n- Organizations: Sega, Nocturnus\n- Concepts: Chaos Emeralds, two dimensions, invasion\n\nFacts:\n- In Sonic Chronicles: The Dark Brotherhood, the story begins after Doctor Eggman has been defeated.\n- In Sonic Chronicles: The Dark Brotherhood, the initial plot centers on the kidnapping of Knuckles and the disappearance of the Chaos Emeralds.\n- In Sonic Chronicles: The Dark Brotherhood, the cast later travels across two dimensions.\n- In Sonic Chronicles: The Dark Brotherhood, the cast meets a new ally named Shade the Echidna.\n- In Sonic Chronicles: The Dark Brotherhood, the cast tries to stop Ix, the leader of the Nocturnus, from invading their world.\n- Dr. Ivo \"Eggman\" Robotnik is a fictional character and the main antagonist of Sega's Sonic the Hedgehog series.",
